# Weekly review: select every Overdue entry, give them all a due date three days out with the prompt, and find them together under one day in Upcoming.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys gO <C-a> md
see Due date
type +3d
keys <Enter>
hide Pay rent
keys gU
see - Renew passport  INBOX
see - Pay rent  Home
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Renew passport @due({today+3})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today+3})
	- Fix the shelf
END
